.TH "atexit_do" "3" "2026\-09\-29" "TheCRatTime" "AtExit reference"
.SH NAME
\fBatexit\fR \- forget about the forgotten \fBfree\fR(3)
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is small library, that only does one thing: call functions at exit.\&
.PP
See \fBREADME.md\fR in project or if you installed and built project, you can see man-pages about functions.\&
.PP
.SS List of functions
\fBInitAtExit\fR(3), \fBSetAtExit\fR(3), \fBDoAtExit\fR(3), \fBAtExitMalloc\fR(3) and \fBAtExitFopen\fR(3).\&
.PP
